      "heading": "B — Audience",
      "learner_facing": false,
      "markdown": "## B — Audience, Section Fourteen Additional Safety Tips\n\nThe audience is first-time never-licensed applicants preparing for the Class C non-commercial knowledge test, reading at a plain-English level. Section Fourteen teaches assorted safety rules only, from defensive driving and belt law through police-stop conduct to small vehicles, cargo, and hazard awareness; it assumes no prior driving knowledge and carries no prerequisites beyond literacy. Rules progress from occupant protection and enforcement encounters through specialty vehicles and hauling to poisoning and disability awareness.\n",
